                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ab79fde-0db0-392f-9374-296fda78ffc2",
                                        "entry_id": "e840a47a-c5dc-36a5-be2a-d0a48d79eab9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In textile inspections, a rough or coarse defect in the woven fabric."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88a44e55-fe0e-3adc-ae35-8801a8779c47",
                                        "entry_id": "e840a47a-c5dc-36a5-be2a-d0a48d79eab9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cigarette."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a5d5e6-8c16-4a26-8c7b-c2a14e0eb048",
                                                "sense_id": "88a44e55-fe0e-3adc-ae35-8801a8779c47",
                                                "text": "He′d Phase Out Fag Industry\nLos Angeles (UPI) - A UCLA professor has called for the phasing out of the cigarette industry by converting tobacco acres to other crops."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20217a1f-6d36-45ce-ad0b-e3f6e627149c",
                                                "sense_id": "88a44e55-fe0e-3adc-ae35-8801a8779c47",
                                                "text": "Oh, rent a flat above a shop / And cut your hair and get a job / And smoke some fags and play some pool / Pretend you never went to school"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ef9b023-f4d8-49a9-8892-b6a48c672a2d",
                                                "sense_id": "88a44e55-fe0e-3adc-ae35-8801a8779c47",
                                                "text": "All of them, like my mother, were heavy smokers, and after warming themselves by the fire, they would sit on the sofa and smoke, lobbing their wet fag ends into the fire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "012750c3-8c5b-4c82-a2ca-f00213e39287",
                                                "sense_id": "88a44e55-fe0e-3adc-ae35-8801a8779c47",
                                                "text": "So I started off by asking the shearers if they minded if I took a belly off while they were having a fag. Then after a while they were asking me. They′d say, ‘Do yer wanta take over fer a bit while I have a fag?’ And then I got better and I′d finish the sheep and they′d say ‘Christ, I haven′t finished me bloody fag yet, yer may as well shear anotherie.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e33d0e29-3467-3d38-bb88-407cfb87b0b8",
                                        "entry_id": "e840a47a-c5dc-36a5-be2a-d0a48d79eab9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The worst part or end of a thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b3bdd97-5a0c-4c57-a910-2b9ae366eb03",
                                                "sense_id": "e33d0e29-3467-3d38-bb88-407cfb87b0b8",
                                                "text": "Fag, s. the worst part or end of anything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fag",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "100cb5de-9fd8-3b1b-9a40-cddff6803c4f",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3a7443-3b13-3964-aef6-f4c585cd28e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A chore: an arduous and tiresome task."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "archaic",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8120e3d6-6f24-4904-9b13-d4de3ce26e19",
                                                "sense_id": "100cb5de-9fd8-3b1b-9a40-cddff6803c4f",
                                                "text": "We are sadly off in the country; not but what we have very good shops in Salisbury, but it is so far to go—eight miles is a long way; Mr. Allen says it is nine, measured nine; but I am sure it cannot be more than eight; and it is such a fag—I come back tired to death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04af27e6-2dcc-3040-ab24-b3274200408d",
                                        "entry_id": "1c3a7443-3b13-3964-aef6-f4c585cd28e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A younger student acting as a servant for senior students."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9d90922-2ca9-4579-a0f8-46c4ad75c9a9",
                                                "sense_id": "04af27e6-2dcc-3040-ab24-b3274200408d",
                                                "text": "I had the character at ſchool of being the very beſt fag that ever came into it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f895487-27f8-4b03-86d8-8c7ae33cf7ec",
                                                "sense_id": "04af27e6-2dcc-3040-ab24-b3274200408d",
                                                "text": "“He was my fag at Eton,” Warrington said. “I ought to have licked him a little more.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddff143c-da2c-407f-b13a-f9a698812f0c",
                                                "sense_id": "04af27e6-2dcc-3040-ab24-b3274200408d",
                                                "text": "A gang of fags was mobbing about by the notice-boards. They fell silent as he approached. He patted one of them on the head. ‘Pretty children,’ he sighed, digging into his waistcoat pocket and pulling out a handful of change. ‘Tonight you shall eat.’ Scattering the coins at their feet, he moved on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
